WEBVTT

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.691
[BOTH CHUCKLE]

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:26.569
[WAILS]

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:31.949
[RUMBLING]

00:00:50.009 --> 00:00:51.552
[GRUNTS]

00:01:44.563 --> 00:01:46.899
[YELLING]

00:02:09.714 --> 00:02:11.340
GINNY:
Neville!

00:02:23.853 --> 00:02:25.646
[PANTING]

00:02:28.524 --> 00:02:30.276
That went well.

00:03:16.572 --> 00:03:20.618
McGONAGALL: Get inside!
This way, everyone. Take cover!

00:03:34.465 --> 00:03:36.008
[SCREAMING]

00:03:38.302 --> 00:03:40.137
HARRY:
Stupefy!

00:03:41.472 --> 00:03:43.098
Get your coat on!

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.393
Ginny. Neville. Are you all right?

00:03:46.435 --> 00:03:51.106
Never better. I feel like I could spit fire.
You haven't seen Luna, have you?

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:53.108
-Luna?
-I'm mad for her!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:57.446
I think it's about time I told her
since we'll probably both be dead by dawn.

00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:03.160
I know.

00:04:08.207 --> 00:04:09.875
[DRACO GRUNTS]

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.691
Bloody hell. We'll never find it on this.

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:36.527
-There he is, just there.
RON: Brilliant.

00:04:36.569 --> 00:04:39.989
He just vanished. Just now. I saw it.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:42.032
[RUMBLING]

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.119
Maybe he's gone to
the Room of Requirement.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.747
It doesn't show up on the map, does it?
You said that last year.

00:04:48.789 --> 00:04:51.250
That's right. I-- I did.

00:04:51.292 --> 00:04:53.002
Let's go.

00:04:53.711 --> 00:04:55.421
Brilliant.

00:05:01.051 --> 00:05:02.720
DRACO:
Come on!

00:06:00.611 --> 00:06:03.113
[VOICES WHISPERING]

00:06:05.699 --> 00:06:07.952
[HIGH-PITCHED RINGING]

